{"id":"atlas-intro","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":3600,"height":200,"text":"**Health and activity / NOS · 1.43-B**\n\n12 system members · 16 one-hop ghost neighbours · 33 canonical edges\nEvery incoming and outgoing edge of a member is shown, including parallel edges. Ghost cards retain status text and gap badges; grey borders mark neighbours unless a high/critical gap requires red. Arrows retain source direction; MISSING means an absent connection, not working data flow.\nCyan data · orange control · green persist · purple schedule · yellow UI · red event.\n[[NOS System Map.canvas|Return to overview]]","color":"5"},
{"id":"hw-strap-hr","type":"text","x":2328,"y":396,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Strap: MAX30102 HR/SpO2**\nOptional back-header PPG module. Not…\n\nruns: Hardware. FIFO drained every 120 ms while leased; background read every 10 min.\n\n`UNKNOWN` · ⚠ [[Gaps|3 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER"},
{"id":"drv-ext-hr","type":"text","x":2328,"y":1136,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**MAX30102 HR driver (ext_hr)**\nStreams red/IR FIFO into…\n\nruns: ext task: FIFO every 120 ms with a lease, first background read +2 min after boot.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"task-ext","type":"text","x":1872,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**ext task (strap service)**\nServices every present strap driver in turn…\n\nruns: prio 0, 4 KB PSRAM, unpinned. Wakes at most every 50 ms; some modules run with the screen off.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"task-board-sense","type":"text","x":2328,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**board-sense task**\nIMU loop (3 reads per cycle, about 150/s)…\n\nruns: prio 2, 4 KB static, no affinity. 20 ms cycle, always on, screen off included.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"1"},
{"id":"task-board-fs","type":"text","x":2784,"y":1900,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**board-fs task**\nDevice retry, SD mount retry, pedometer NVS…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB. 100 ms loop, always on.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|1 gap]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-hub","type":"text","x":48,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Services hub (svc_init / svc_tick)**\nservices_tick = svc_tick + background_tick,…\n\nruns: UI task. Every frame when ON; once a second in OFF, AOD and SENSOR.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Services hub|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-sports-logger","type":"text","x":504,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Sports journal (sensor/event logger)**\nQueues 64 B checksummed records (SP_IMU,…\n\nruns: sports_tick 1 Hz; 60 s records; IMU records from board-sense.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-workout","type":"text","x":960,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Workout session engine**\nRuns sessions (start/pause/lap/finish),…\n\nruns: workout_tick in svc_tick; 1 Hz screen off; checkpoint 30 s.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|13 gaps]]\n[[Sports and workouts|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"1"},
{"id":"svc-heart","type":"text","x":1416,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Heart aggregation service**\nCombines the live locked reading, the…\n\nruns: heart_tick every 60 s on the UI task.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"svc-phone-link","type":"text","x":1872,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Phone line pump and status reporter**\nphone_tick: drains NUS lines, tracks…\n\nruns: svc_tick on the UI task.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|14 gaps]]\n[[Followup 6 - Gadgetbridge inbound and outbound message audit and phone-link failure modes|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-activity","type":"text","x":2328,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Activity service (svc_activity)**\nTurns pedometer output into daily steps, km,…\n\nruns: act_tick 1 Hz on the UI task, also screen off. Checkpoint every 10 min when dirty.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|14 gaps]]\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"svc-time","type":"text","x":2784,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**System clock and timezone (hal)**\nOwns time(), TZ from prefs, setters used by…\n\nruns: Library code; frame-latched datetime for the UI.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|4 gaps]]\n[[Followup 1 - Time source, RTC trust and midnight rollover end to end|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-wrist-detect","type":"text","x":3240,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Guided wrist-side detector**\nA 4 s guided capture from the IMU that…\n\nruns: Only while Sports DETECT WRIST is open.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"svc-pedometer","type":"text","x":3696,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Pedometer and walk detector**\nCounts steps from the 3 Hz-filtered IMU with…\n\nruns: board-sense every 20 ms; calendar day re-checked at most 1 Hz.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"svc-calendar-gate","type":"text","x":4152,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Pedometer calendar gate**\nDerives the local date from time()+tz and…\n\nruns: board-sense, at most once per second.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Followup 1 - Time source, RTC trust and midnight rollover end to end|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"svc-tuning","type":"text","x":4608,"y":2664,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Gesture tuning**\nWalk and knock thresholds (sportstune, 20 B)…\n\nruns: Read on every IMU sample.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"store-ram-hr-history","type":"text","x":1644,"y":3428,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**HR history ring (144 samples)**\nOne bpm per 10 minutes for 24 h in PSRAM,…\n\nruns: PSRAM. Written by the ext task.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"store-nos-prefs","type":"text","x":2100,"y":3428,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**nos_prefs (RAM struct)**\n52 B in-RAM preference struct loaded at boot…\n\nruns: RAM. Read by the engine every frame; written by apps then prefs_save().\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|15 gaps]]\n[[Settings and developer|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"store-nvs-nosact","type":"text","x":2556,"y":3428,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**NVS nosact (activity history)**\n92 B v2 blob holding day/week/hourly/active-…\n\nruns: NVS. In-frame commit.\n\n`PARTIAL`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"store-nvs-pedometer","type":"text","x":3012,"y":3428,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**NVS pedometer (24 B)**\nToday's step record (version, day key,…\n\nruns: NVS. 60 s, retry 5 s, plus shutdown flush.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Health and activity|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"4"},
{"id":"app-breathe","type":"text","x":1188,"y":4168,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Breathe**\nPaced breathing (4 s in, 2 s hold, 6 s out)…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition).\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|5 gaps]]\n[[Breathe|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
{"id":"app-heart-rate","type":"text","x":1644,"y":4168,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Heart rate**\nLive HR and SpO2 from the MAX30102 strap…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). Widget refresh when history older than 60 s.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|5 gaps]]\n[[Heart rate|Open note]]\n● SYSTEM MEMBER","color":"3"},
