{"id":"app-energy","type":"text","x":2556,"y":4168,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**Energy**\nDaily steps-based kcal, food and water…\n\nruns: UI task, only while it is the top screen (or in a transition). History refresh every 10 s.\n\n`PARTIAL` · ⚠ [[Gaps|13 gaps]]\n[[Energy|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
